docs/RUNTIME-QUALITY-ASSESSMENT-2026-07-27.md:22:| R5 | **Cross-window task graph** (phases as tasks, no window barrier) | the mapped ~2× lever; overlaps materialize/trace/EPD/score/emit | 19:30→12–15 min (subsumes R1 residual) | 1–2 weeks | High (determinism; PERF-ATTEMPT-1 died here) — only after R1–R4 |
