docs/RUNTIME-QUALITY-ASSESSMENT-2026-07-27.md:36:| Q4 | **Open-search correctness as a release gate** — charge abstention, monoisotope offset, mass-window; only `spx_guessed` is stamped though `open_search_safe` promises isotope-offset metadata | wrong charge/mono → lost IDs or false delta-mass structure; existential for speXtract's actual use | little closed gain, big open-search validity | 3–5 days | Low algo risk |
