docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/vibe.md:104:**Comparison:** Banded run vs **bands=1** (unpartitioned) on the same window.
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/vibe.md:114:1. Run **one** representative window unbanded (bands=1) → reference trace set T₁
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/vibe.md:115:2. Run the **same window** with bands=N → trace set T_N
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/vibe.md:117:4. Aggregate across a **stratified sample** of windows (e.g., 5 wide, 5 narrow, 5 medium)
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/vibe.md:120:**Cost:** One full window at bands=1 is ~18 min / 160 GB. For a 24-window diaPASEF run, this is 18 min × 24/24 = **18 min** for one window plus negligible for banded versions.
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/vibe.md:122:**Honest reporting:** Add a log line: *"Banding approximation: X% trace set difference vs unbanded (window sample)"*
