docs/reviews/window-loop-perf-2026-09-03/codex.transcript2:5301:   839	    registerDoubleOption_("consolidate:delta_rt", "<sec>", 0.0, "FALSIFIED on S30 (-12.7% peptides at 5 s; every merge/collapse variant lost) -- keep 0 = OFF. Consolidate spectra whose precursors agree within this RT window (and mass_ppm/delta_im) into ONE feature, keeping the richest spectrum. Attacks emission multiplicity (ours 4.6 PSMs/peptide vs diaTracer 1.46) without changing fragment content.", false);
