docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/codex.transcript:351:    52	  @brief Extracts pseudo-MS/MS ("pseudo-DDA") spectra from diaPASEF (ion-mobility DIA) data.
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/codex.transcript:353:    54	  Reconstructs DDA-like MS2 spectra from ion-mobility DIA (timsTOF / diaPASEF) data by
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/codex.transcript:354:    55	  exploiting the fact that, in PASEF, fragments are recorded at the ion-mobility (1/K0)
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/codex.transcript:355:    56	  elution coordinate of their precursor. Precursor and fragment mass traces are detected
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/codex.transcript:356:    57	  IM-aware (@ref MassTraceDetection with an ion-mobility tolerance), then fragments are
docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/codex.transcript:357:    58	  assigned to a precursor when they co-localize in ion mobility, retention time, and
