  1221	    registerDoubleOption_("trace:ms1_split_valleys", "<chrom_fwhm>", 7.0, "Split MS1 mass traces at chromatographic valleys via ElutionPeakDetection. DEFAULT 7.0 s: MassTraceDetection never splits at a local minimum, so two peptides eluting ~25 s apart within the m/z tolerance merge into ONE multi-modal trace, producing a merged precursor with the wrong monoisotope and charge. Measured +36.7% peptides on S23 and +37.4% on S08 at peptide-level FDR. Costs ~1.7x wall time and ~25% peak RAM. 0 = off.", false);
