b0f72f8 (HEAD -> coverage-analysis-2026-07-24) Design: trace detection on integer arrays, all three axes integer
a529c03 Cap windows in flight again: the task pool fixes occupancy, not the working set
1a7158e Score gate reads a parallel array, not the 96-byte trace record
fff3c8e Plan: index the mobility axis as TIMS scans, and the measurement that says the gate scan is the real cost
7570389 Re-apply the flight-time calibration at EXPORT, not during extraction
e01dfd9 Integer detector: exact banding by construction (drift cap + halo of twice the tolerance in bins), run as tasks
194ab05 Merge the flight-time m/z axis and the integer detector into the master/worker line
f1430a9 Halo sized per band edge, and the stage-timer label corrected to elapsed-time-summed rather than CPU-seconds

